    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests the variable-prefix configuration of {@link StrSubstitutor}. <p>The prefix can be configured in three ways:</p> <ul> <li>{@code setVariablePrefix(char)} &rarr; backed by a {@code CharMatcher}</li> <li>{@code setVariablePrefix(String)} &rarr; backed by a {@code StringMatcher}</li> <li>{@code setVariablePrefixMatcher(StrMatcher)} &rarr; the matcher is stored as-is</li> </ul> <p>{@link #assertPrefixImpl} / {@link #assertSuffixImpl} assert which {@link StrMatcher} implementation currently backs the prefix / suffix. The suffix is never changed here, so it must always remain a {@code StringMatcher}.</p>"
   },
